  "source_code": "MOD = 998244353\r\nMAX_N = 200000\r\n\r\n\r\ndef func():\r\n    inv = [0] * (MAX_N + 1)\r\n    H = [0] * (MAX_N + 1)\r\n    \r\n    inv[1] = 1\r\n    \r\n    for i in range(2, MAX_N + 1):\r\n        inv[i] = MOD - (MOD//i) * inv[MOD%i] % MOD\r\n    \r\n    for i in range(1, MAX_N + 1):\r\n        H[i] = (H[i-1] + inv[i] % MOD)\r\n    \r\n    return H \r\n\r\ndef func2(a, H):\r\n    n = len(a)\r\n    ans = 0 \r\n    \r\n    for i in range(n):\r\n        coe = H[i] + H[n - i - 1]\r\n        coe %= MOD\r\n        \r\n        ans+=a[i] * coe\r\n        ans%=MOD\r\n    \r\n    return ans\r\n\r\ndef func3():\r\n    H = func()\r\n    t = int(input())\r\n    \r\n    for _ in range(t):\r\n        n = int(input())\r\n        a = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n        print(func2(a, H))\r\n        \r\nfunc3()",
